# '숏5 하락장' 페이퍼 봇 (owners 10/25 "내일 실거래봇은 일단 돌려야", docs/short5-bot-ko.md): 숏 위주 5개 매매법
# (V39_ALL 15분 숏, S6_EMA_DMI_ADX 15분 숏, F12_MSS 1시간 숏, N12_ICHI_AO 30분, F16_FIB382 4시간), BTC 4시간 장세가 하락일 때만
# 진입, 12→10 계단, 증거금 40% x BTC 40배 / 나머지 30배 (deploy/combo.short5.json). The same program, user and sandbox as
# paperbot-combo.service, its own config /etc/paperbot/combo-short5.json and its own database
# /var/lib/paperbot/combo/short5.db (account COMBO@mix in that file). ONE live executor follows it once its config says
# "paper_db": "/var/lib/paperbot/combo/short5.db" (deploy/short5_switch.py, while that executor holds no position); the
# other executors keep following their bots. Paper only: no orders. Its research members read Binance's public 1m / 1h / 4h
# klines (paperbot/rmember.py RData) and compute their own signals from 5m history (paperbot/combo.py CustomSignals).
#
# install.sh installs this unit but never enables or starts it. A person starts it after writing
# /etc/paperbot/combo-short5.json (docs/short5-bot-ko.md):
#   sudo systemctl enable --now paperbot-combo-short5
# Telegram: its start and error lines and its own entry / exit lines ("[합친 봇 페이퍼 숏5 하락장] ...") go to the owners'
# chats. Restart is safe: the account, its signal queue and the last minute are in its database; missed minutes are
# replayed from paper3.db, missed signals are recorded late and never traded.
[Unit]
Description=paperbot combined bot '숏5 하락장' (5 short-led members in the BTC 4h down regime, its own config combo-short5.json; no orders)
After=network-online.target paperbot-live3.service
Wants=network-online.target
StartLimitIntervalSec=0

[Service]
Type=notify
User=paperbot
Group=paperbot
WorkingDirectory=/opt/crypto-bot-research
EnvironmentFile=/etc/paperbot/live.env
# the live bot's token and the owners' private chats (optional, deploy/live-telegram.env.example)
EnvironmentFile=-/etc/paperbot/live-telegram.env
Environment=PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1
ExecStart=/opt/paperbot/venv/bin/python -m paperbot.combo run --config /etc/paperbot/combo-short5.json
Restart=always
RestartSec=15
NotifyAccess=main
WatchdogSec=600
TimeoutStartSec=20min
TimeoutStopSec=60
Nice=5
MemoryMax=1500M
# a live executor follows this paper bot: in a server-wide memory shortage experiments go first (owners 2026-10-19)
OOMScoreAdjust=-500
NoNewPrivileges=yes
PrivateTmp=yes
ProtectSystem=strict
ProtectHome=yes
RestrictAddressFamilies=AF_UNIX AF_INET AF_INET6
ReadWritePaths=/var/lib/paperbot/combo
InaccessiblePaths=-/etc/paperbot/agents.env -/etc/paperbot/dash.env -/etc/paperbot/executor.env -/etc/paperbot/debate.env -/var/lib/paperbot/exec -/var/lib/paperbot/debate -/var/lib/paperbot/.claude -/var/lib/paperbot/.claude.json -/var/lib/paperbot/.local -/var/backups/paperbot

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
